# OCF (Plan B C6) harness gitignore
#
# results/ is intentionally NOT ignored -- per the harness contract the
# summary.tsv + agreement.json + manifest.sha256 are committed so reviewers
# can audit numerical agreement without re-running the pipeline.  This
# mirrors the policy set by Tier 1 hyprcoloc / coloc harnesses (see commit
# d1b9a60 -- persist hyprcoloc results/ (override global gitignore)).
# The repo-root .gitignore has a generic results/ rule (line 62); the
# negation pattern below + an explicit -f on add is the standard escape hatch.
!results/
!results/**

# Generated fixtures + intermediate outputs (never committed).
data/
outputs/

# R / Python artefacts
__pycache__/
*.Rout
.Rhistory
.RData

# Install marker (per-machine state)
.install_marker
